msgstr "Diferencia con el mercado al cierre (%)"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_config__competition_leader_gap
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_res_config_settings__purchase_competition_leader_gap
msgid ""
"How far above the market a price must be to count as leading it, with room "
"to lower."
msgstr ""
"Qué tan por encima del mercado debe estar un precio para considerarse líder,"
" con margen para bajar."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_config__competition_overbid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_res_config_settings__purchase_competition_overbid
msgid "How far above the market price the recommended price goes."
msgstr "Qué tan por encima del precio de mercado queda el precio recomendado."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order_line__price_gap
msgid ""
"How far our net price sits above (positive) or below (negative) the market "
"price."
msgstr ""
"Qué tan por encima (positivo) o por debajo (negativo) del precio de mercado "
"está nuestro precio neto."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_competition.res_config_settings_view_form_purchase_competition
msgid "How requests for quotation are measured against rival buyers' offers"
msgstr ""
"Cómo se miden las solicitudes de cotización frente a las ofertas de "
"compradores rivales"

