msgid "Purchase Order Line"
msgstr "Línea de pedido de compra"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order_line__recommended_price
msgid "Recommended Price"
msgstr "Precio recomendado"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_competition.purchase_order_form_competition
msgid "Record a Competitor Offer"
msgstr "Registrar una oferta de competidor"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:purchase_competition.competitor_offer_action_purchase
msgid "Record what a rival buyer offered one of your vendors"
msgstr "Registre lo que un comprador rival ofreció a uno de sus proveedores"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_competition.field_competitor_offer__purchase_order_id
msgid "Request for Quotation"
msgstr "Solicitud de cotización"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order__competitor_ids
msgid "Rival Buyers"
msgstr "Compradores rivales"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order_line__market_price
msgid ""
"The highest comparable price a rival buyer offers for this product: to this "
"vendor when known, else to its industry, else to the market. Per this line's"
" unit."
msgstr ""
"El precio comparable más alto que un comprador rival ofrece por este "
"producto: a este proveedor cuando se conoce, si no, a su industria, si no, "
"al mercado. Por la unidad de esta línea."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order__market_position
msgid "The least favourable position among the order's lines."
msgstr "La posición menos favorable entre las líneas del pedido."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_product_category__purchase_min_margin
msgid ""
"The margin over what we pay that our resale price must keep for a product of"
" this category. Empty: the company's."
msgstr ""
"El margen sobre lo que pagamos que nuestro precio de reventa debe conservar "
"para un producto de esta categoría. Vacío: el de la empresa."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_config__competition_min_margin
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_res_config_settings__purchase_competition_min_margin
msgid ""
"The margin over what we pay that our resale price must keep, for a product "
"whose category sets none."
msgstr ""
"El margen sobre lo que pagamos que nuestro precio de reventa debe conservar,"
" para un producto cuya categoría no define ninguno."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order_line__recommended_price
msgid "The market price plus the overbid, never above the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"El precio de mercado más la sobreoferta, nunca por encima del precio máximo."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order__price_gap_at_close
msgid ""
"The order's gap to the market, weighted by line, when it was won or lost."
msgstr ""
"La diferencia del pedido con el mercado, ponderada por línea, cuando se ganó"
" o se perdió."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order__competitor_ids
msgid "The rival buyers whose offers compete with this request."
msgstr "Los compradores rivales cuyas ofertas compiten con esta solicitud."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:purchase_competition.selection__purchase_order_line__market_scope__partner
msgid "This Vendor"
msgstr "Este proveedor"

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_competition.field_purchase_order__market_rank
msgid ""
"Where this order stands among the competitor offers linked to it, compared "
"on the products each offer quotes: 1 when no offer beats it."
msgstr ""
"Dónde queda este pedido entre las ofertas de competidores vinculadas a él, "
"comparadas en los productos que cotiza cada oferta: 1 cuando ninguna oferta "
"lo supera."

#. module: purchase_competition
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:purchase_competition.win_loss_action_purchase
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:purchase_competition.menu_purchase_win_loss
msgid "Win/Loss Analysis"
msgstr "Análisis de ganados y perdidos"
